NOTE ON THE CLASSIFIER

The MIT licence above covers the Python source in this repository.

Since version 0.2.0, oats-scan bundles no binaries. The compiled classifier
it runs is part of pheo-oats, which oats-scan installs as a dependency;
pheo-oats is proprietary software of Pheo Inc., distributed under its own
terms. Versions before 0.2.0 bundled the same classifier under
src/oats_scan/_bin/, under the terms stated in those versions.
